OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feel-good stories about
OL,8,Fpeople, places and animals across our
OL,9,Fregion - and we like to shout about
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThis week, we're featuring a daring dog
OL,13,Frescue, a cycling challenge inspired by
OL,14,FKevin Sinfield and the celebration of a
OL,15,Fwell-known fundraising figure.
OL,17,FChildren have made their own floral
OL,18,F"carpet" using flowers left over from a
OL,19,Fgiant artwork in Bradford city centre.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
