OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vast display in Centenary Square
OL,7,Fwas made from more than 330,000
OL,8,Fdahlias, with the design celebrating
OL,9,Fthe city's textile history and
OL,10,Fmulticultural population.
